# Laamo API requests for VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client.
# Set @token to the output of: scripts/dev-token.sh you@example.com

@base = http://localhost:8787/api
@token = paste-token-here

### Health (no token)
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Me
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a workspace
# @name created
POST {{base}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Bäckerei Krause", "timezone": "Europe/Berlin", "locale": "de"}

### Get it
GET {{base}}/workspaces/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### About me facts (empty value forgets a fact)
PATCH {{base}}/workspaces/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profile": {"city": "Leipzig", "business": "bakery", "offer": "fresh bread and cakes"}}

### Bad timezone → 400
PATCH {{base}}/workspaces/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"timezone": "Mars/Olympus"}

### A Feed card (Check first / Let me pick show their cards). Set @card to a feed card id.
@card = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{base}}/feed-cards/{{card}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check first: approve all but one, fix one email (card ids from the GET above)
POST {{base}}/feed-cards/{{card}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "edited", "skip": ["<card id>"], "edits": {"<card id>": {"email": "hallo@example.com"}}}

### Ask me something
POST {{base}}/feed-cards/{{card}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "answered", "answer": "Leipzig"}
